GAL22V10
BANK2

Clock RESET LOAD D0 D1 NC NC NC NC NC NC GND
NC EXT NC NC NC NC NC NC FLAG Q1 Q0 VCC

Q0.R = /RESET * LOAD * D0 + /RESET * /LOAD * Q0
Q1.R = /RESET * LOAD * D1 + /RESET * /LOAD * Q1
FLAG = EXT * Q0 * /Q1

DESCRIPTION
Illustrative DIP24 synchronous two-bit bank register.
On rising Clock: RESET high clears, else LOAD high loads D1:D0,
else Q1:Q0 holds. RESET is synchronous and has priority over LOAD.
EXT on pin 14 demonstrates using an output-capable pin as an INPUT.
Q0/Q1/FLAG are continuously driven; there is no external output enable.
No dedicated asynchronous reset or synchronous preset is requested.
This is not an approved pin assignment for a physical 7xsys board.
